This repository rebuilds a 2024 project, github.com/daisyKim12/autonomous_driving, which
was built with my kid. The 2024 controller in jdp/controller.py is ported from that project's
rf_live_detection.ipynb, and the 2024 training pipeline in jdp/data.py follows its
rf_train_model.ipynb.

Third-party code and data used but not vendored:
- YOLOv5, Ultralytics, AGPL-3.0 (https://github.com/ultralytics/yolov5). Cloned into
  third_party/ by the setup instructions, used to train and export the stop-sign detector.
- 2024 stop-sign dataset: Roboflow "stop" v2 export (CC BY 4.0), whose images are crops
  from the German Traffic Sign Recognition Benchmark (GTSRB), class 14. Fetched from the
  2024 repository, not redistributed here.
- torchvision ResNet18 ImageNet weights (BSD-3-Clause).
- NVIDIA JetBot road-following notebooks (MIT), the origin of the 2024 notebooks' structure.
